    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7202" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">causātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		causa, II. C. (postclass.). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A pretext</i>, <i>an excuse</i>, <i>apology</i>, <i>plea</i>, Cod. Th. 3,
			5, 2; <i><span class="en">Tert. ad Marc. 5, 20</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aegri corporis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell. 20, 1, 30</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A disease</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rara,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pall. 1, 4, 1</span></i>
			.</div>
